  (text "KIRO Wiring V2  |  Red_Motion_Warning_Light"
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e8ba37fe-cf0b-4e94-bd48-61983b5c6786")
  )
  (text "Fail-to-warning: light is ON whenever K1 is closed, unless the Jetson actively holds it OFF with a live pulse train"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e505df3b-0dae-4bf8-9c3e-42cb6cc8558e")
  )
  (text "SOFTWARE MEANING:  MOTION_WARNING_REQUEST active  =  stop toggling BEACON_HOLDOFF_PULSE  =  light ON"
    (at 25.4 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e8430edf-9d5f-422e-b594-bd5c8b5b5180")
  )
  (text "Light OFF only while the heartbeat thread toggles GPIO01 (J12 pin 29) at >= 100 Hz square wave. Frozen, crashed, booting or powered-off Jetson = light ON (if armed)."
    (at 25.4 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "aadc2800-20fc-4541-b135-623ba0be32c0")
  )
  (text "CHARGE-PUMP WATCHDOG (estimate, verify on bench)"
    (at 25.4 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ef6051c9-96c0-4124-8d39-d180576b0176")
  )
  (text "Pulses through C61 and D60/D62 charge C62 to ~2.2-2.5 V -> Q2 on -> BEACON_ENABLE pulled low -> Q1 off -> light off."
    (at 25.4 218.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "aa31c376-6a54-48b6-a5c2-543929257d91")
  )
  (text "Pulses stop (either level) -> C62 bleeds through R65: tau = 100k x 1uF = 0.1 s -> Q2 off within ~0.1-0.15 s -> R60 pulls gate up -> light on."
    (at 25.4 223.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "000153f4-c6a5-4de3-96a4-3a81446ce75f")
  )
  (text "Gate drive ~ BEACON_12V x 100k/110k = 9-13 V. D63 clamps Vgs. Q1: Vds >= 30 V, Id >= 3x lamp current, Rds(on) specified at Vgs = 10 V."
    (at 25.4 228.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f571eb91-c97c-4940-bef2-836690282916")
  )
  (text "R63 100k (> 50k rule): pin floats at boot -> buffer input low -> no pulses -> light ON while armed (fail-safe)."
    (at 25.4 233.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4e44575e-521f-41f3-9140-066f70391646")
  )
  (text "Feedback U61: LED across the lamp. Lamp energised -> BEACON_STATE_N LOW. Confirms drive, not filament - check lamp at bring-up."
    (at 25.4 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "75bf5ebd-f28a-43bc-9a51-2eb0f47c5059")
  )
  (text "POWER PATH: 12V_AFTER_CONTACTOR -> F_BEACON (Power_Distribution) -> BEACON_12V -> J60.1 -> lamp + ... lamp - -> J60.2 -> Q1 drain -> Q1 source -> POWER_GND"
    (at 25.4 248.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1f888874-0031-4f40-af20-7c3c948d9198")
  )
  (text "GENERIC: lamp 12 V 5 W (~0.42 A). F_BEACON 2 A (LED inrush), 20 AWG, J60 5 A, Q1 IRLZ44N (55 V, Rds 22 mOhm @10 V). Re-check when the lamp is measured."
    (at 25.4 254 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "aeb204dc-2fe8-4012-994c-f3c66b82796a")
  )
  (text "Polarity: generic LED beacon is polar - red wire to J60.1 (+). TVS not required for a lamp/LED load."
    (at 25.4 259.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ae7cd2f1-d7a3-444a-83e4-e068ab5f3425")
  )
  (text "SEQUENCE  1 non-zero wheel cmd -> 2 stop pulses (request) -> 3 light on, confirm BEACON_STATE_N low (timeout 0.5 s -> refuse motion, log)"
    (at 25.4 269.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a01bc3d3-83fc-492e-be1c-e1164533ec99")
  )
  (text "          4 wait 0.5 s -> 5 forward wheel cmd -> 6 keep light on while any cmd != 0 -> 7 after zero cmd keep on 1.0 s -> 8 resume pulses (light off)"
    (at 25.4 274.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f67a2881-e0ce-4a64-8b22-7691e7582741")
  )
